        "description": {
          "value": "<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-oLHQNmH2SfmnI0uK\"><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack</em>: +9 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 17 (2d10 + 6) piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) fire damage. If the auger moves at least 20 feet in a straight line toward the target immediately before the hit, the target takes an additional [[/damage 2d10 type=piercing average]] damage, and if the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 17 Strength saving throw or have the &amp;Reference[prone] condition.</p></section><p>The auger attacks with its flaming drill.</p>",
